[{"form_id":"0x000802|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やあ、私はアウリ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000803|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"たまたま甘いロールが二つあるんだが。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000804|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ムルルルグ。腹が減った。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000805|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それでだ、イニゴ。好奇心が疼いて仕方ないんだが……カジートは嬉しいと喉を鳴らすのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00085E|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なあ、イニゴ。こっちに来て、これを一口飲んでみろよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000866|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何を飲みたい？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うぅ、私のあざにまたあざができちゃったみたいだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000872|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前の兄弟のことはすまなかったな、イニゴ。あんな風に誰かを失うことがどれほど辛いか、想像もつかない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087E|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺は一度可愛い山賊の少女に恋をしたことがある。　彼女は俺の心を奪い、目の前で食べたのさ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087F|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"なぜ人間の肉を持ち歩いているんだ？　ウッ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000880|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"私はウッドエルフと共通点が多い。木を愛し、弓を弾き、病に強く、忍び寄る機械のようなものだ。我々はとてもよく似ている。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000881|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気をつけろ、この場所は人種差別の臭いがする。お前の種族はここでは人気がない。俺のも同じだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000882|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ここに来てから地元の連中に何か嫌がらせを受けたか？　人種差別のことだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000883|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そんなに緊張しなくていいんだよ、イニーゴ。私は敵を食べるだけだから。あなたは友達でしょ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000885|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"イニゴ、私のために何かしてくれる？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C1|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"弓術は好きか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C2|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"弓と剣の腕には自信があるか？　それが俺の得意分野だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C5|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あなたの種族は動物と話せるのよね？　私のノミと話してくれないかしら？　一日休むように頼んだのに、全然聞いてくれないのよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000808|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"はじめまして、私の名はイニゴです。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080A|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"こちらこそ会えて嬉しいよ。これからはお互い、友の背中を守ることになりそうだな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そうだな、まったくもって。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080F|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"剣の腕はからきしだが、弓の腕は一流だ。お前が剣に専念するなら、俺たちは無敵だろうな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000811|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そうだといいな。お前と仲間になれて嬉しいよ","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000816|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"イニゴ、君は...？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000818|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"はい。……また。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081A|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"（笑う）","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"冗談はやめてくれ、友よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00081F|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、それは分かる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000821|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"一つ欲しいか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000823|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"正気か？ それには小麦粉が入ってるんだぞ！ つまり、すり潰した植物の死骸だ。この野蛮人め。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000825|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"分かった、分かった！ もう！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000828|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"大いに。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082A|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"賭けをしないか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どんな賭けだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082E|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今日はお前よりも多くの敵を倒してみせるぜ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000830|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"受けて立つよ。弓にかけては稲妻より速いんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000832|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ、俺もだ。お前より少しだけ速いかもしれないな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000834|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺より速いだと？　そんな馬鹿げた話は生まれて初めて聞いたぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000837|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"今日は信じられないほど血に飢えているんだなあ。ちょっと深呼吸してみるのもいいぞ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000839|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ごめんよ、イニゴ。ただ腹が減ってるんだ。また何か殺せるかな？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083B|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"間違いなくすぐにだ。それまでは、お前の邪魔をしないようにしようと思う。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00083E|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いや、俺はそうは思わない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000840|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"確かめてみないか？こっちへ来い、耳の後ろを掻いてやる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000842|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ええと…いいえ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000844|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"急に恥ずかしくなったのか？　おいで、ニャンちゃん、ニャンちゃん、ニャンちゃん。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000846|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何がおかしいんだ？ ","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000848|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"(くすくす)","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うん？ 私に聞いてるのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00084E|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"友よ、少し休んだらどうだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000850|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いや、大丈夫だ。ただ...妹のことを考えていただけだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000852|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その話をしたいのか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000854|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"彼女の顔が恋しい。あの馬鹿げた笑い声も。ただ……皮肉な話だな。俺はこの世界で最も愛したものを救うために選択したんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000854|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そしてその選択のせいで、彼らに二度と会えない。永遠に。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x000856|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくやった、あなたの愛が彼らを害から守ったのだ。それがあんなにも大きな代償を要したのは残念だが。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000858|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとう、イニゴ。そう言ってもらえて嬉しいよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00085A|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いつでもどうぞ、友よ。いつでも。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00085C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よくやった、チーム！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00085D|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"みんな、手足はまだ全部ついてるか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000861|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何を飲んでるんだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000863|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"これはジャガだ。牛乳でできている。気に入るかもしれない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000869|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ロットメスがあるか調べてくれ。なければ、ミルクを一杯だけ頼む。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086B|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よし、それじゃ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00086F|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"休息を、友よ。何か食べるものを用意しよう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000871|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ありがとう、イニゴ。あなたは宝物よ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000877|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"彼について話してくれる？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000879|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"彼の名はファーガス。勇敢で優しく、それに、はは、少し見栄っ張りだった。俺が知る中で最も偉大な男だったよ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000879|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"彼のことはいつも心から恋しく思っている。だが、他の日よりも辛い日もある。","index":2},{"form_id":"0x00087B|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あなたが本当に彼を愛していたのが分かる。彼を心に留めておきなさい。暗いときには、彼の存在があなたに力を与えてくれるわ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087D|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いい考えだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000888|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本気か？　櫛とフロストバイトの毒の石鹸を手に入れればいい。それでお前の蚤もすぐに片付くだろう。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088A|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"俺のノミは俺が一人のときに仲間になってくれる。知り合ってみれば、面白い奴らだよ。どうやら俺は美味しいらしい。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088C|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おや、本当かい？　もっと聞かせてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088E|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いや、そうは思わない。とにかく、この会話はお前を腹ペコにさせている気がする。話題を変えたほうがいいかもしれないな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000891|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あら、なんてロマンチックなの！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000894|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ？　一度に獲物を丸ごと食べてみろよ。後で食べるために取ってあるんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000896|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どれほど腹が減っていようと、「おお、うまそうな死体がある」なんて思ったことは一度もない。お前は好き嫌いが激しくないんだな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000898|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"裁くような真似はやめろ。お前らしくない。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00089B|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふん。そういうことになるな！ だが俺の知るウッドエルフで、お前ほど毛深い奴は一人もいないがな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00089D|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"一理あるな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00089F|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前には可愛らしいひげもあるな。とても立派だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A1|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"はい、本当です。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A4|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"分かっている。念のため、武器を手放すな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A7|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"時々な。たいていは無視するが、たまにやり返すと面白いこともある。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008A9|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"確かに。話しかけてやればそれだけ隙を見せてくれるからね。阿呆どもと罵ってやるのも満足感がある。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008AB|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、そうだ。時々彼らを怖がらせるのが好きなんだ、少し牙を見せてな、分かるだろ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008AD|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、賛成だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B0|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"よし。誰かの餌食になる気はない、お前のでさえもな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B2|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"それに、カジートはひどく頑丈だ。革のブーツを噛み切ろうとするようなものだ。お前たちの種族は、ただあまり美味しくないだけさ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B4|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ノミがそう考えているようだ。お前の食欲をそそらないなら安心だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B7|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":" 痛っ！今、俺の尻尾を引っ張ったな？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B9|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あなたはそれで私の顔を何度も叩いてるのよ！やめて、さもないと噛みちぎるからね！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BB|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"わー！　向かってくる！　止めろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BE|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前、俺に動物操作の術を使っているだろう？俺は逆らえないんだ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C0|018inigobanterpatch.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前は本当に愚かだ。","index":1}]